  "description": {
   "en": "1-3, 7–12. Sorrows of Alicia / Lamenting Alicia\nLong ago, the ferocious goblins were driven to a solitary island in the middle of a lake, allowing the walled city of Selbis to flourish for over 250 years. Two knight orders are tasked with monitoring the goblins, but in recent months, there have been repeated incidents of women being assaulted by goblins, but only in the area under the jurisdiction of the Rogues (also translated as “Loguth”) Knight Order. Alicia, the only daughter of the leader of the Rogues, begins investigating why these incidents are only occuring in their jurisdiction.\n\n4-6. Windhole Figo - Also published in Volumes 2–4 of [An Anthology Comic in Which I, the Party Outcast, Take Revenge on the Friends Who Betrayed Me](https://mangadex.org/title/19ad7fb1-5e8d-4768-969b-d71cc7c1f374)\nAmong a crew of body-modded pirates, only Figo remains unmodded. However, despite the lack of modification, Figo is still highly skilled and helpful on missions. Even the boss's daughter, Baney, has fallen for him!\n___\n**Buy *Sorrows of Alicia* Chapters Individually:**\n- [Amazon](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B09DWP22D8)\n- [BOOK☆WALKER](https://bookwalker.jp/series/313616/)\n- [ebookjapan](https://ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp/books/653005/)\n\n**Buy *Windhole Figo* Chapters Individually:**\n- [Amazon](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B0BF4F7DQM)\n- [BOOK☆WALKER](https://bookwalker.jp/series/374131/)\n- [ebookjapan](https://ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp/books/717955/)"
  },
